# AEGIS USA · CEO 2026-09-04 · un-gitignored per India's proven pattern.
# Prior gitignore left workstation parquets stale for weeks (CI regenerated
# but never committed back). Root fix · track parquets, commit-back from CI.
# Size envelope · 915 tickers × 62 KB avg = 55 MB (comparable to India's 265).
# usa/data/raw/us/*.parquet   (now tracked)
usa/data/archive/

